        "base": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/feed/",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_1 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019d like to notify you of upcoming proactive network policy optimisation we\u2019re undertaking across school firewalls now that the Managed Network Upgrade is complete. This work will run from </span><b>early July through to the end of September.</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019ll be reviewing school firewall configurations to ensure policies and security profiles are standardised across all schools, helping keep things safer and running smoothly. This includes:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Standardising naming and structures</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Removing unused configurations</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Everything should continue working as normal, and no action is needed.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, if you do notice something isn\u2019t working as expected, like an app or website isn\u2019t accessible on your network, please contact our Customer Service team on 0800 532 764 between 8am \u2013 5pm Monday to Friday.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/inform-maintenance-to-school-firewalls/\">Inform: Maintenance to school firewalls</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
